WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Welcome to the AI Medicine Collective,

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:05.450
where clinicians, trainees, researchers,

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.380
and curious thinkers explore

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.000
the evolving edge of AI in healthcare.

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:12.450
We share practical tools,

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.040
ethical guidance, and creative experimentation

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.400
across every training level.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.600
No technical background required.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.300
If you're ready to push the boundaries

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.100
of what medicine can be,

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.600
click Join above to become a member.
